  "coverage": "Clang/LLVM source coverage of pecl/yaml 2.3.0 (yaml.c, parse.c, detect.c) and source-built libyaml 0.2.5 during yaml_parse() on a valid control; AFL++ feedback comes from the allowlisted yaml.c/parse.c/detect.c and libyaml reader.c/scanner.c/parser.c in the native overlay",
  "coverage_subject_prefix": "/work/source/pecl-yaml-2.3.0/",
